OL,3,GNEWSASevere drought declared in parts
OL,4,Aof southern England
OL,5,
OL,6,FA severe drought has been declared
OL,7,Facross parts of southern England after
OL,8,Fmonths of low rainfall.
OL,10,FParts of Cornwall, Devon, Dorset,
OL,11,FSomerset, East Sussex and West Sussex
OL,12,Fare affected by the announcement from
OL,13,Fthe Environment Agency, which followed
OL,14,Fa review of water resources and drought
OL,15,Fconditions across England by the
OL,16,FNational Drought Group.
OL,18,FWater supplies have been significantly
OL,19,Fimpacted by high demand following the
OL,20,Fhottest summer on record.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
